The '''Running Start Campaign''' (初心者応援キャンペーン, ''Shoshinsha Ōen Kyanpēn'', '''Beginner Support Campaign''') is an event that is held at random times in [[The Battle Cats]]. This event features half-off energy costs for the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]], [[Treasure Festival]]s, unique [[Missions]] and unique [[Daily Bonus|Login Stamps]].

==Event Information==
Now's the time to start playing The Battle Cats during the {{Color|#FF9900|'''Running Start Campaign!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from November 16th (11:00am) until November 30th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the Empire of Cats, Into the Future, or Cats of the Cosmos will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Available after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Daily Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!

On {{Color|#34A853|'''even days visit Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#4285F4|'''odd days head to Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
{{Color|#8E7CC3|'''Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos on 11/18, 11/21, 11/24, 11/27, 11/30!'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Limited Missions with Grand Rewards added!'''}}<br>
New missions have been added with clear rewards for stages in Empire of Cats!<br>
Clear the stages for each mission to earn rewards such as {{Color|#FF0000|'''Rare Tickets'''}} to access Rare Capsules, {{Color|#34A853|'''Leadership'''}} to restore Cat Energy, and {{Color|#4285F4|'''XP'''}} to power up your Cats!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Rewards for completed Missions can only be claimed before the end of the event, so don't forget to claim your prize before then!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Earn 10,000 XP every day to help power up your heroes!'''}}<br>
Log in to The Battle Cats during the event to earn a gift of {{Color|#FF0000|'''10,000 XP every day'''}}! Power up your Cats with XP to make them stronger!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Running Start Campaign login bonuses can only be collected before clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3.

